    "body": "> The fact that \"hand-off to external software\" uses token keywords, instead of flag names, seems like a preexisting spec bug. The token keywords do not exist at this point, and are not the type of thing which a sandboxing flag set contains.\r\n> [...]\r\n> I would offer to fix this so that you could build on a better foundation,\r\n\r\nI see. Thanks!\r\n\r\nI was quite happy this PR to be straightforward. it would make me sad to see it polluted by fixing pre existing issues. I would prefer fixing pre existing issues separately. I will prepare another PR to address this.\r\n\r\nedit: I changed my mind, since they both require me to add the specific flag. It is easier to make one patch instead.",
