    "body": "Thanks @domenic \r\nI think I addressed all your comments.\r\n\r\nI also turned list of token into `<ul>`, sorted alphabetically. This is more readable. This also make me realized two token were missing in one list. I fixed it.\r\n\r\nSome images of the change:\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4759106/155508618-a024962c-d86e-4f48-8b7f-f52bc8afe538.png)\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4759106/155508351-9fac4a41-b0aa-4b6b-92d4-4546a1c0750f.png)\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4759106/155508231-dbe7ba1a-0cd8-4254-948e-0992d0f238fa.png)\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4759106/155508865-b02abfbb-7897-4629-8dc1-f2f4a4baf53f.png)\r\n\r\n</details>",
