    "updated_at": "2022-02-28T13:23:57Z",
    "body": "Well, it's not always handed off externally, is it? For instance, when `registerProtocolHandler()` is used. Ideally they all end up using the same code path though, whether it's translated to HTTP or handed off externally, as otherwise you can find out something about the user. And from that perspective always performing a (COOP-like) top-level navigation would be best when it's translated to HTTP.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I don't care too strongly about the exact name, just want to make sure we consider these aspects.",
